---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const locale = 'en' as const;
const lastUpdate = '2026-05-05';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale={locale}
  title="Privacy policy — Waldex"
  description="How Waldex processes personal data."
  canonicalPath="polityka-prywatnosci"
  noindex={true}
>
  <article class="container-default pt-12 md:pt-24 max-w-[68ch] prose-content">
    <h1
      class="text-[length:var(--text-h1)] leading-[var(--leading-h1)] font-semibold"
    >
      Privacy policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[var(--color-iron)] font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">
      Last update: {lastUpdate}
    </p>

    <p class="mt-12 p-4 border border-[var(--color-rust)] bg-[var(--color-bone)] text-sm">
      <strong>Draft.</strong> Final text will be filled in once company details
      (legal name, tax ID, registered address) are confirmed.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
    <p>
      The data controller is <strong>[COMPANY NAME]</strong>, tax ID
      <strong>[TAX ID]</strong>, registered at
      <strong>[ADDRESS]</strong>. Contact:
      <a href="mailto:Waldemar.sewerynn@gmail.com">Waldemar.sewerynn@gmail.com</a>,
      phone +48 608 038 746.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Purposes and legal bases</h2>
    <p>We process personal data for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Responding to enquiries</strong> — Article 6(1)(b) GDPR (steps
        taken at the data subject's request prior to entering a contract)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contract performance</strong> — Article 6(1)(b) GDPR
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Site analytics</strong> (Google Analytics 4) — Article 6(1)(a)
        GDPR (consent given via the cookie banner)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Tax and accounting obligations</strong> — Article 6(1)(c) GDPR
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Retention period</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Quote correspondence: 12 months from last contact</li>
      <li>Contract and financial documents: 5 years (per accounting law)</li>
      <li>Analytics data (GA4): 14 months</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data subject rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access your data, rectify it, delete it, restrict
      processing, port it, object, and lodge a complaint with the Polish
      President of the Personal Data Protection Office.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Recipients</h2>
    <p>
      Data may be passed to trusted processors acting on our behalf: email
      provider (Google Workspace), contact form (Web3Forms), analytics platform
      (Google Analytics 4 / Cloudflare Analytics), hosting (Cloudflare Pages —
      Germany/EU).
    </p>

    <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      Cookie details are described in our
      <a href="/en/cookies">Cookie policy</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
